Open questions:
  1. [resolved] What should the default perturbation be when the caller does not supply one?
       The diff sets `DEFAULT_PERTURBATION = Perturbation(name="add-unrelated-test", apply=add_unrelated_test)` and uses it as the default value of `measure_instability(..., perturbation: Perturbation | None = DEFAULT_PERTURBATION)`, so when the caller omits the argument the default perturbation is explicitly `add-unrelated-test`.

